        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Has someone ever told you to touch grass, but you just couldn’t bring yourself to do it? Well, boy, do I have good news for you: In Grass Toucher, you can do it as much and as long as you want.   <br>   <br>Aside from the breathtaking experience of touching grass, Grass Toucher features:   <br> <br>  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun and satisfying clicker gameplay</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming 2D graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist and clean interface</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 unique buildings to buy</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >210 special upgrades to unlock</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >47 Steam achievements</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed stats menu to view your progress</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Golden Grass power-up for temporary boosts</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Peaceful backgrounds to calm your soul</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bright sun to meet your virtual vitamin D needs</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic grass-touching sound effects</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing music by Kevin MacLeod</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto and manual save systems</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support for 31 languages</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully playable using only a mouse</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional setting to turn your cursor into a hand</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idle and active gameplay styles</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suitable for both short and long play sessions</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16:9 resolution and fullscreen support</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Low system requirements</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No internet required</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No microtransactions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now it's time to touch some grass. Show the world how many times you've done it, and become a true Grass Toucher. And don’t forget to touch <strong>&quot;Add to your wishlist&quot;</strong> button. It's the second best thing you can touch.</p>",
